  {
   "block_type": "Heading",
   "title": "Dismantling & Inspection Procedure"
  },
  {
   "block_type": "Text",
   "content": "<p>To facilitate complete internal inspection, the following procedures were performed:</p><ul><li>Removed external covers and protective panels.</li><li>Safely discharged the DC Bus capacitor bank.</li><li>Removed power modules (IGBT assemblies).</li><li>Removed IGBT Driver Boards for detailed inspection.</li><li>Inspected all PCB assemblies for damaged components.</li><li>Inspected capacitor banks and verified capacitance values.</li><li>Examined busbars, terminals, cooling assemblies, and internal wiring.</li></ul>"
